###############################################################################
# qmldir — directory manifest for this Quickshell configuration
#
# READING THIS FILE
# ------------------
# Every .qml file in this folder is registered here as a "module component".
# That is what lets OTHER files use them without an import statement, e.g.
# shell.qml can simply write `Volume { }` because "Volume" is registered below.
#
# FORMAT
#   <type name>  <version>  <file name>
#
# TYPES
#   * <FILE.qml>          → a normal reusable component (use it like <Type> { })
#   * singleton <NAME>    → only ONE instance exists, accessed by its name
#
# Note: qmldir only matters in the SAME directory as the config entry point
# (shell.qml). Quickshell reads it automatically.
###############################################################################

# --- Global design tokens (colors, fonts, sizes) -----------------------------
# The "singleton" keyword means every file can use `Theme.fontText`,
# `Theme.barBg`, etc. without creating an instance. Edit values in Theme.qml.
singleton Theme 1.0 Theme.qml

# --- The wallpaper (drawn by quickshell itself — no hyprpaper) ----------------
singleton WallpaperState 1.0 WallpaperState.qml  # active path + persistence
singleton PaletteState   1.0 PaletteState.qml    # per-wallpaper color palettes
Wallpaper        1.0 Wallpaper.qml                # per-monitor background surface

# --- Reusable UI capsules (the "pill" family) --------------------------------
Pill           1.0 Pill.qml          # 2-part capsule: icon | label
ActionPill     1.0 ActionPill.qml    # Like Pill, but stretches to fill width
QuickToggle    1.0 QuickToggle.qml   # Big toggle tile: icon + title/status + chevron
CustomSlider   1.0 CustomSlider.qml  # Slider tile: icon + draggable track

# --- Bar widgets (one file per feature on the top bar) -----------------------
Workspaces     1.0 Workspaces.qml    # Workspace pips + overview (expo) button
Volume         1.0 Volume.qml        # Audio volume pill (click/wheel)
Dictation      1.0 Dictation.qml     # Speech-to-text record pill (hyprwhspr)
Hub            1.0 Hub.qml          # Center clock → expands into a floating window
CalendarGrid   1.0 CalendarGrid.qml # Month calendar (Hub calendar/weather tab)

# --- Panels -------------------------------------------------------------------
# QuickSettings is a whole PanelWindow (the dropdown), not just a widget.
QuickSettings  1.0 QuickSettings.qml